sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Controller as StatisticsController
    participant Service as StatisticsService
    participant StatisticsDao as StatisticsDao
    participant DeliveryDao as DeliveryDao
    participant JobDao as JobDao

    Note over User, JobDao: 企业用户统计
    User->>Controller: 进入"企业统计"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取企业数据
    activate Service

    %% 统计浏览量
    Service->>Service: 统计职位总浏览量
    activate Service
    Service->>JobDao: SUM(view_count)
    activate JobDao
    JobDao-->>Service: 总浏览量
    deactivate JobDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回浏览量
    deactivate Service

    %% 统计接收量
    Service->>Service: 统计简历接收量
    activate Service
    Service->>DeliveryDao: 统计投递给该企业的记录
    activate DeliveryDao
    DeliveryDao-->>Service: 简历接收数
    deactivate DeliveryDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回接收数
    deactivate Service

    %% 统计邀约与转化
    Service->>Service: 统计面试邀约量
    activate Service
    Service->>DeliveryDao: 统计status='INTERVIEW'的记录
    activate DeliveryDao
    DeliveryDao-->>Service: 邀约数
    deactivate DeliveryDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回邀约数
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 计算转化率<br/>(邀约数/接收数)

    Service-->>Controller: 返回企业统计数据
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>User: 展示企业统计卡片
    deactivate Controller